ans_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":400,"thumbheight":267,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/DZ3_0627_A_night_market_stall_in_Sattahip_Thailand_-_vendors_weigh_durians_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/DZ3_0627_A_night_market_stall_in_Sattahip_Thailand_-_vendors_weigh_durians_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":400,"height":267,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/DZ3_0627_A_night_market_stall_in_Sattahip_Thailand_-_vendors_weigh_durians_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/DZ3_0627_A_night_market_stall_in_Sattahip_Thailand_-_vendors_weigh_durians_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DZ3_0627_A_night_market_stall_in_Sattahip_Thailand_-_vendors_weigh_durians_as_a_young_buyer_uses_his_phone_to_scan_or_pay_while_another_customer_captures_the_scene_on_their_smartphone.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=196954245","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"This vibrant nighttime scene captures a bustling durian vendor stall at what appears to be a night market in Sattahip, Chon Buri Province, Thailand. Two vendors are at work behind the stall - one wearing a white cap and dark shirt with white gloves, standing near a large yellow weighing scale with a metal bowl on top, and another taller vendor in a white shirt reaching out and handling what looks like a payment or receipt. In the foreground, spiky durian fruits are prominently displayed, with more visible on the counter. A customer's hand extends from the left side of the frame, holding up a smartphone, likely to make a digital payment via QR code, which is common in Thai markets. The scene is illuminated by overhead lights and decorated with hanging yellow signs, creating the lively, authentic atmosphere of a Thai street market specializing in the region's famous \"king of fruits.\"","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/PattayaPatrol/\">PattayaPatrol</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"92301519":{"pageid":92301519,"ns":6,"title":"File:Data supporting mobile application development for use within the Marine Air-Ground Task Force (IA datsupportingmob1094547220).pdf","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":3932865,"width":1275,"height":1650,"pagecount":100,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf/page1-500px-Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":400,"thumbheight":518,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf/page1-960px-Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf/page1-500px-Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":400,"height":518,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf/page1-960px-Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_%28IA_datsupportingmob1094547220%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Data_supporting_mobile_application_development_for_use_within_the_Marine_Air-Ground_Task_Force_(IA_datsupportingmob1094547220).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=92301519","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\nAdkison,  Jesse D.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<p>The United States Marine Corps has identified a need to provide handheld devices to allow operators to conduct wireless command and control-related functions. To fulfill this need, the Marine Corps initiated a program that aims at providing secure cellular communication capabilities down to the individual Marine to address gaps in existing command and control systems. Common wireless communication technologies that are typical within the average enterprise entity, such as text, email, and file sharing, among many others, do not exist on an individual level within the Marine Corps. One of the next steps in advancing the implementation of handheld devices is to map requirements for information exchange to mobile device applications. This thesis accomplishes this mapping and identifies the application space where trusted devices offer the greatest potential for benefit to the Marines of the Major Subordinate Elements. While a suite of approved applications for military use may become available in the future, the initial applications for trusted devices can accomplish the needs for many users, thereby maximizing the utility of these devices in the short term.\n</p>\n<br>Subjects: mobile device; mobile application; Marine Corps; Information Exchange Requirements; Marine Air-Ground Task Force; trusted handheld; IER; MAGTF; TH2</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"130176060":{"pageid":130176060,"ns":6,"title":"File:Digital payment.pdf","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":104478,"width":1239,"height":1754,"pagecount":7,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Digital_payment.pdf/page1-500px-Digital_payment.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thum